     :       ProjectionExec: expr=[name@0 as name, amount@1 as amount, pdb_eval_expr_opexpr_0c292ba6(amount@1) as join_proj_push_down_1]
     :         CooperativeExec
     :           PgSearchScan: table=o, segments=1, visibility=eager, query={"with_index":{"query":{"term":{"field":"name","value":"bob"}}}}
